PS5 Mamba-1 Vulkan SSM scan for the NexusAI llama.cpp pin 620d2225. Adds
ssm_scan_mamba1.comp: one invocation per channel, a per-channel decay vector A
(d_state 16), no state snapshots. SSM_SCAN with a non-scalar A is routed to it
in ggml-vulkan; the Mamba-2 path is unchanged. Nothing here is upstream at this
pin. Shader compile is checked only by the NixOS build.

